<!--
  Simulated-location route for Xcode (Debug > Simulate Location, or the
  scheme's Core Location options): a drive across Singapore's NEA zones on the
  afternoon of the 2026-08-02 storm, passing the S909 station cluster at the
  moment its five-minute total hit 11.6mm.

  Waypoint times are UTC (15:05 SGT = 07:05Z); Xcode paces movement by the
  deltas. HistoricalReplayTests pins each coordinate to the zone it must
  resolve to, so this route and the automated expectations cannot disagree.
-->
